  ------------------------
    WAVEFUNCTION SUMMARY
  ------------------------

  MO formalism                     : Unrestricted
  Calculation type                 : KS-DFT
    (single det. built from the Kohn-Sham orbitals)
  Number of atoms                  : 3
  Number of basis functions        : 24
  Primitive gaussians              : 47
  Spin density (FChk)              : found
  Occupied MOs (nocc/alpha/beta)   : 5 / 6 / 4
  SCF/DFT energy (au)              :       -76.1310699377

  -----------------
    INPUT SUMMARY
  -----------------

  # METHOD
  --------
  Atomic partitioning (real-space)     : TFVC (Topological Fuzzy Voronoi Cells)
  Energy decomposition                 : ENPART (one- and two-center IQA terms, see below)

  # ENPART
  --------
  Functional              : custom libxc ids 0 106 131
  Atom-pair skip threshold: THREBOD = -1
  Two-electron grid       : MOD-GRIDTWOEL (user-selected integration grid)

  # GRID
  ------
  Radial points              : 40
  Angular points             : 146
  Rotation angles (phb1/phb2):  0.162 /  0.182

