  -----------------------------
    SETTING ATOMIC DEFINITION
  -----------------------------

  Using stiffness k: 4
  Using density along atom pairs to set atomic radii

  Atom pair   1 -   2 : 1 max / 1 min extrema; inconsistent extrema, selecting minimum closest to midpoint
  Atom pair   1 -   2 : subdivision 28, ratio  4.78035
  Atom pair   1 -   3 : 1 max / 1 min extrema; inconsistent extrema, selecting minimum closest to midpoint
  Atom pair   1 -   3 : subdivision 28, ratio  4.78035

  Checking sum of AOs overlap matrices
  (deviations may not affect overall accuracy of MOs)

  TIMING CPU  :: atomic definition                                 0.22 s
  TIMING WALL :: atomic definition                                 0.04 s

